---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Cookie Policy | Eversales">
  <main class="bg-slate-50 pt-24 pb-20">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="spotlight-item bg-white rounded-[2.5rem] border border-slate-200 p-8 md:p-16 shadow-sm transition-all duration-500">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-8 tracking-tight">Cookie Policy</h1>
        
        <div class="prose prose-slate prose-lg max-w-none text-slate-600 space-y-8">
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">1. General Usage</h2>
            <p>We use cookies and similar tracking technologies to enhance your experience, analyze site traffic, and support the functionality of our booking systems.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">2. Categories of Cookies</h2>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
              <li><strong>Essential:</strong> Necessary for the site to function securely.</li>
              <li><strong>Analytics/Functional:</strong> Helping us understand how users interact with our "Sales Engine" story so we can refine our architecture.</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">3. User Control</h2>
            <p>Most browsers allow you to manage or delete cookies through their settings. Please be aware that disabling cookies may impact your ability to schedule calls or view certain interactive elements.</p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  
  <script>/* Spotlight logic shared across pages */</script>
</Layout>